OL,3,GNEWSAResurfaced road to be dug up again
OL,4,Amonths later
OL,5,
OL,6,FA badly potholed road completely
OL,7,Fresurfaced six months ago at a cost of
OL,8,F#280,000 will be dug up again next week
OL,9,Ffor "essential" work.
OL,11,FGranhams Road, between Cambridge and
OL,12,FGreat Shelford, was repaired in March
OL,13,Fafter it fell into a poor condition,
OL,14,Fwith a cyclist warning there would be
OL,15,F"a very serious accident soon".
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
