OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAResurfaced road to be dug up again
OL,4,Amonths later
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe road will now be closed between 5
OL,7,FOctober and 1 November so Cambridge
OL,8,FWater (CW) can replace part of a water
OL,9,Fmain. CW said that when the work back
OL,10,Fin March was carried out "our teams
OL,11,Fwere focused on higher-priority water
OL,12,Fmain renewals elsewhere".
OL,14,FCambridgeshire County Council said
OL,15,Futility companies were "required to
OL,16,Freinstate the road surface to the same
OL,17,Fstandard or better".
